<title>UK: Trinity wins Hong Kong bus order.</title>
<headline>Trinity wins Hong Kong bus order.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-03-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Britain's Trinity Holdings Plc said on Tuesday that it had won orders to supply a total of 421 double-deck buses to Hong Kong's three largest bus operators in a deal worth around 70 million stg.</p>
</text>
